==== stdout ====
Usage: raphael help [<command> | <topic>] [--json]

Read command help and cross-command guidance.

Commands take precedence over topics. Help works without a connection or saved login.

help reference prints every page in one stream.

Options:
      --json
      Print machine-readable command definitions.
  -h, --help
      Show help.

Examples:
  raphael help create
  raphael help reference
  raphael help --json search

Prints:
  Help text, or machine-readable definitions with --json.

Next: raphael help reference
